        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trapped on an island ruled by a ruthless <strong>dictator</strong>… well, no one really knows his name. No one knows who he is—he’s never appeared anywhere in person. He’s sealed every escape route: the docks are shut and the boats are burned. You, being an ex–art thief, tried to escape, but here… nothing goes without consequences (you lost your left eye). It’s only been three weeks since you arrived <i>accidentally</i>, and already the island feels like a prison that’s slowly learning <u>your name</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the village, <strong>help</strong> the villagers, try to regain your sight, <strong>complete</strong> interesting missions and make friends on the island (you will need them later xdddd).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover the island’s <span class=\"bb_strike\">secrets</span>, you’ll need to use your strategic thinking, and your <i>thief</i>’s instincts to survive. Sneak through guarded areas (well the guards are pretty bad at their work but still...) and make moral choices that does not affect how others see you (hmmm sad). </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trapped on an island ruled by a ruthless <strong>dictator</strong>… well, no one really knows his name. No one knows who he is—he’s never appeared anywhere in person. He’s sealed every escape route: the docks are shut and the boats are burned. You, being an ex–art thief, tried to escape, but here… nothing goes without consequences (you lost your left eye). It’s only been three weeks since you arrived <i>accidentally</i>, and already the island feels like a prison that’s slowly learning <u>your name</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the village, <strong>help</strong> the villagers, try to regain your sight, <strong>complete</strong> interesting missions and make friends on the island (you will need them later xdddd).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover the island’s <span class=\"bb_strike\">secrets</span>, you’ll need to use your strategic thinking, and your <i>thief</i>’s instincts to survive. Sneak through guarded areas (well the guards are pretty bad at their work but still...) and make moral choices that does not affect how others see you (hmmm sad). </p>",
        "short_description": "A short-story game where you play as a retired art thief. Cool, huh? Guess what? No! There’s a dictator on the island where this takes place, and he literally cut out your left eye. Now you’ve got to complete the challenges like that! What a shame?",
